-PageAttention input. See
-[test_aclnn_msa_index_score.cpp](../examples/test_aclnn_msa_index_score.cpp)
-for complete BBND, BNBD, TND, INT8, FP8, empty-sequence, strided-page, and wide
-block-table accuracy cases.
